       inside that GENERATED table's own file (see Races_Primitive.xml's
       header for why the family layer itself is hand-authored, not
       generator output — this file is hand-authored too, so no such
       collision risk here). Same imported-brain-trio economy as every
       other family (ruling 6/8: "the brain, which they can't do at all
       ever" applies to every chassis, Primitive included — only the
       CASING and the rest of the chassis are Jawa-built). Art: an unused
       existing KotOR portrait icon (Icon_GOTO, none of the other 7 heads
